<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE PROJECT</p><h1>Qsys Sensor App</h1><p class="lede">A warehouse indoor navigation platform, built in small, verifiable milestones.</p></section>
<section class="about-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">PURPOSE</span><p>Help warehouse teams understand indoor movement through calibrated maps, device sensors and reliable positioning.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">CURRENT FOUNDATION</span><p>.NET 10 · Blazor WebAssembly · ASP.NET Core API · Clean Architecture</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">CURRENT MILESTONE</span><p>Milestone 3 — Drawing Engine in progress. The workspace supports common raster image previews, sanitized SVG and common DXF entities, with zoom, pan, rotation, visibility, point-based calibration, grid snapping and undo/redo. TIFF preview and licensed DWG conversion remain pending.</p></div></section>
